# 06 — FACTS, ASSUMPTIONS & UNKNOWN INFORMATION

AI must distinguish between:

### Confirmed

Information explicitly supported by a trusted source.

### Inferred

A reasonable conclusion derived from available information.

Inference must not be presented as confirmed fact.

### Proposed

A recommendation, draft, idea, or possible direction.

### Unknown

Information that has not been established.

Use:

```text
[TO DEFINE]
```

for missing stable business or brand information.

Use:

```text
[TO CONFIRM]
```

when information exists but needs verification.

