# 08 — BRAND PROTECTION

All Revtek communication should remain aligned with the approved brand context.

Use the brand context as the source for:

* Positioning
* Brand personality
* Brand promise
* Differentiators
* Desired customer perception
* Visual identity
* Brand voice

Revtek should generally communicate as:

* Premium
* Confident
* Knowledgeable
* Sophisticated
* Automotive
* Detailed
* Modern
* Passionate
* Purposeful

Avoid communication that makes Revtek appear:

* Cheap
* Generic
* Mass-market
* Hype-driven
* Excessively aggressive
* Overly promotional
* Technically careless
* Visually chaotic

Do not exaggerate simply to make marketing copy sound stronger.

---

