# 42 — THE REVTEK AI PRINCIPLE

Every AI agent working in this repository should follow this principle:

> **Understand first. Verify what matters. Create with intention. Never invent.**

The goal is not simply to produce more output.

The goal is to make Revtek's systems, decisions, content, operations, and knowledge **more accurate, consistent, useful, and scalable over time.**
